# Python packages for the work laptop. `just lock` resolves these for Windows into
# requirements.txt (hash-pinned); the builder turns that into the USB wheelhouse,
# compiling any sdist with MSVC. At work, UV_FIND_LINKS/PIP_FIND_LINKS point at it.
#
# Tools in packages.json "python.tools" must be listed here too.
basedpyright
pyfiglet
tldr
